		{"text"},
		line=1371,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050a"},
		line=1371,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Twenty minutes after escaping from Elsa's clutches.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I've made it all the way back to Yogarasu District, remaining wary of being tailed all the while.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Did Hotori and Akari manage to make it out safely?",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I slink into an alley next to a drug store.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It took you so long... I was so worried...”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Nearly on the verge of tears, Hotori runs up to meet me.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?! Look at all your injuries!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, they sure messed me up a little.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This isn't just 'a little,' you jerk...”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where's Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry. She's safe.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But forget about her. We need to treat your─”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That can wait.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aah...”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I step past Hotori and check on Akari, laying in the back of the alley.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She's leaning against the wall and sleeping with a peaceful expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank goodness.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Relief surges through me, and my exhaustion finally begins to set in.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The strength leaves my legs, and I sit down next to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks for taking care of her, Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't mention it.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori mutters, averting her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let me treat your wounds.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"With that, Hotori begins tearing strips off her own clothes to stop the bleeding.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The touch of her practiced movements sets me at ease.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Feels like you're used to patching me up like this, from before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You 'feel' that way because it's true...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You were awfully strong, though, so you hardly ever got hurt.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anyways, what happened to those Republican soldiers? Did you take them out?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We talked it out peacefully.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? How'd you manage that?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, things happened...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What do you mean 'things'? What happened?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a long story, and it's nothing too interesting.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I quickly cut Hotori off before she starts interrogating me.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What bothers me, though, is that Elsa came to the warehouse after getting a tip-off.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Elsa, huh? Right...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you think someone set us up?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's possible. I don't know who, though.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a groan.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When Akari wakes up, let's ask her what happened.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For now, let's head back to the shop.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, you're in pretty bad shape.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can move just fine, thanks to you.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"My wounds are pretty bad, but we don't have time to take it easy.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I move next to Akari and carry her on my back. She's lighter than I expected.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnh... ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"On the way to the shop, I hear a moan from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Huh? ...Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're finally awake? Good for you.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...You're safe!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Akari nuzzles her cheek against my back.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? Yeah, I'm doing just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I passed out all on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It wasn't your fault.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides, I should be the one apologizing.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was so incompetent as to allow my own lord to be kidnapped.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way. I have no right to blame you.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Akari answers in a quivering voice.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"We seem to be just barely talking past each other.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Akari must still be confused after everything she's been through.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Um, Soujin. I can walk on my own from here.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“O-Oh. Alright.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I stop and set Akari down.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Akari stands on her own two feet.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"She checks my body for injuries once again.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... These wounds are terrible.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Akari grimaces, gently touching my body.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That guy did all this to you...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That guy?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was the Republican Army that I fought against.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? But he captured you and then─”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you talking about? Nobody ever captured me.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But he captured you, and he was about to kill you, and I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"As though still dizzy, Akari staggers where she's standing.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The blood completely drains from her face.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah, I'm fine.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think I was having a bad dream while I was asleep.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"She forces an awkward smile.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"It seems like there's a discrepancy with her memories.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Just what in the world happened to her?",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you have any idea who did this to you?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I didn't see his face, but I think he's working with Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He kept telling me to stay away from Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Okonogi, huh?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"He might've been the one to sic the Republican Army on us, in that case.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Getting the Republicans to do all the dirty work while keeping his hands clean.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Sounds just like a method he'd use.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So was his objective to get you to leave Okonogi alone?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Probably.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did you say?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“O-Of course I refused!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And because of that, he cut my face all over...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Akari puts her hand to her cheek.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"She touches it over and over, as though to really make sure that there's nothing on her hands.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Akari's face is as beautiful as ever.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"There's not a single trace of any cuts or bruises.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh...? What? Wait, did you find someone to Heal me?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I look at Hotori, who also shakes her head.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It was... all a dream?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Akari's face clouds over in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Perhaps her memories are still in a jumble from the terror and trauma of having been abducted.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"No, from the very beginning, everything about this kidnapping has been incomprehensible.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Someone went to the trouble of kidnapping Akari, but all they did was tell her to stay away from Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"On top of that, they went out of their way to avoid using violence, and by the time we arrived, the culprit was already gone without a trace.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I doubt they just stepped outside to pick up a pack of cigarettes or anything.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't make heads or tails of what the kidnapper was after.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Think it was just meant as a threat?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though that's an awful lot of trouble to go to just to threaten us.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"If it's Okonogi we're talking about, he already knows where we live.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"If all he wanted to do was threaten us, he could've gone with a much simpler scare tactic, like setting the shop on fire.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't like this one bit. We can't let our guard down.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I agree.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At any rate, I'm just glad you're okay.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"At this, Akari floats a troubled smile.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'm back.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Akari timidly opens the door to her room.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Akari-san, you're okay!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Kotone clings onto Akari.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank Oomikami! Thank Oomikami!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not know what I would have even done if... Oh, thank Oomikami!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Kotone buries her face in Akari's chest and sobs uncontrollably.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hear you were the one that found where I was being held. Thank you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, I hardly did any... Oh, I am just so glad to see you safe and sound!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“No, no, this was all Your Eminence's doing.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I know it doesn't mean much coming from an inept practitioner like me, but your magicks are truly incredible.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The manager praises Kotone with a haggard smile.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"We saw it during the Honing of the spellblade as well;\nKotone's powers are truly immense.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Akari gently pats Kotone on the head.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I also want to express my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, you're a lifesaver.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am most unworthy of your praise...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wa─you look like a dead man walking, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please lie down at once!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Quickly now! ≪Hurry, hurry, hurry!≫”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you mean? Oh, I sure was in a pretty hairy situation, yeah!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It means get your butt in bed this instant, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Zzz... Zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"When Kotone finishes healing me, she falls into such a deep sleep it's like she's passed out.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"She's used up too much spellforce.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"On the other hand, my wounds are completely healed.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"It's unfair to compare her to the manager, but her capabilities truly are on a completely different level.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now that's what makes her the Exalt-Priestess. My magicks can't even begin to compare.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, your magicks are still...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“No need to be polite. I've only dabbled in it, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Weeeell then, I think I'm gonna get some shut-eye until\nit's time to open.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"The manager lets out a big stretch.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Looking out the window, I see the night already beginning to give way to dawn.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for everything tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll escort Kotone back to the Imperial Temple.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Please do.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Counting on you, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Akari calls out, absentmindedly stroking Kotone's hair.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm gonna head home as well.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, thanks for your help.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Still feeling up for school today?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Hotori gives me a grin and heads out with the manager.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be back in a bit. Akari, make sure you get some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Akari gives me a tired nod.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"The terror of having been kidnapped seems to have drained all of her energy.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm so sorry for letting you get abducted.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like I'm all talk and no action.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First I pass out in the Warrior District, and now I've gone and let you get kidnapped...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Warrior District thing was just a freak accident.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And you didn't do anything wrong today, either.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I already know that Akari would never blame me.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"But that means it's doubly wrong to keep taking advantage of her kindness.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If ever you decide that you're better off without me, just say the word.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, cut that out.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I mean it.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I declare while meeting her eyes head-on. Akari responds with a strained smile.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're really way too serious for your own good.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But all right... I'll humor you.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I ever decide I don't want you anymore, you'll be the first to know.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. That'd be the best for the both of us.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you satisfied now?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you. I'll be back.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"With a deep bow, I withdraw from Akari's room.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I give Kotone a ride back to the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry for having you escort me all this way. You must be very exhausted.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm in way better shape than you seem to be. Do make sure to get a nice, long rest.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly, sir. Though, I have my daily duties to attend to shortly.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"She chuckles with a cheerful expression.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"She can't even afford to take a day off?",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"The life of a priestess must be a tough one.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Before you depart, sir, might I ask you a few things about what happened last night?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Did you happen to notice anything strange about the place Akari-sama was being held?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's awfully vague. What do you mean by that?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not quite understand it myself, but when I was searching for Akari-sama's whereabouts, I sensed a strange portent.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe that location had some peculiar magicks about it.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Magicks?",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"I wrack my mind trying to think of anything strange that happened.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, there was this one thing.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It sounds like while she was being held, she had a dream where I was also captured.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She says it was all just a dream, but it still seems to be weighing pretty heavily on her.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A dream? A dream, you say...”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Kotone crosses her arms in thought.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm... I believe I will have to think about this.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are there really magicks capable of giving people nightmares?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If it is merely a question of whether it is possible or not, the answer would be the former.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, it is forbidden to ever use such malicious magicks, and it would be a big deal if it were discovered.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The more I learn, the scarier magicks seem.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, is there even anything that magicks\ncan't do?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In theory, there is not.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is Oomikami Himself who bestows us with these boons of miracle. We priestesses have nothing to do with it.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Although, the skill of the supplicant may determine whether their prayers successfully manage to reach Him.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, how do your own skills measure up?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is not a secret I would reveal lightly, even to you, sir. I could not guarantee your safety were you to find out...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Kotone smugly shows me her best villainous smile.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"But I do seem to recall her bragging about having blown away a hill just the other day...",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, what do you think about the manager's powers?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm, I do not know whether it is right for me to say this...”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"She glumly crosses her arms.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“His techniques are indeed orthodox, but I harbor my doubts as to whether he is truly an ordained priest.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The way he conducts himself is rather different from how we were trained to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, he did say he only dabbled in it.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe it is exactly as he says.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"The manager tells us that he was formerly a priest, but his past is still shrouded in mystery.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"No, no. it's wrong for me to be doubting my kind benefactor.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"It'd be best to stop prying any further.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well then, I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really saved us today. Thanks again.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perish the thought, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If even someone the likes of me is capable of rendering useful assistance, that gladdens me beyond words.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"She gives me a bright, thousand-watt smile befitting a young shrine maiden.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Overflowing with genuine elation at being praised, her beaming face is as radiant as a sunflower.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I really should have asked before you went so far to help us, but will you be all right yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Lending us your aid could bring negative consequences upon the Temple.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That goes for maintaining our spellblades, as well as getting involved with Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would not blame you if you wished to end your involvement before things get even more serious.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Kotone appears to ponder my words seriously for a while.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"But soon, she's wearing the same charming smile as before.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As I stated before, I wish to learn how my predecessor met her end.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would not be wrong of you, sir, to believe that this is one of the reasons I continue to associate with you. For this, I do beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And so, it is only fair that I should gladly do your bidding in turn.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, I suppose I'd better get my memories back as soon as I can.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“By all means, sir! Please remember to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"She laughs jokingly.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"It seems Kotone has her own designs.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"That's honestly much more reassuring than unconditional kindness.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your predecessor passed away during the war, is that right?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How much do you know as of now? And is it alright for me to ask?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not mind in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My predecessor was stationed with maintaining the Barrier with a unit of priestesses under her precedence.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Barrier is the greatest Artifact in the realm, built up by generations of venerable priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When the war broke out, I am certain that those one hundred priestesses stationed there fulfilled their duty to the utmost.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But as you are surely aware, the Barrier still collapsed. Moreover, not one of those priestesses have returned, even now.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"So they're all dead, huh?",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it not possible to investigate the Barrier?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Kotone dejectedly shakes her head.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have entreated the chancellor countless times, but he has never once granted me permission.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe the implication is clear...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Kotone, who usually speaks in such a straightforwardly honest manner, utters an uncharacteristically suggestive accusation.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"From the Republic's point of view, the Barrier is a defensive installation that absolutely needed to be neutralized.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"If Okonogi really sold us out to the Republic, there's a good chance he tampered with the Barrier in some way.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Whether by destroying it himself, or by inviting in foreign saboteurs.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“By all rights, I should have been there maintaining the Barrier myself.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And yet on that fateful day, I caught cold, and so...”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To think that I used a matter so trivial as catching cold... as a childish excuse...”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I owed my predecessor such an irreparable bond of gratitude... and that was how I repaid her...”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Kotone's voice is choked out by sobs.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"I see. So even someone like Kotone labors under a heavy burden of guilt.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"She's always wearing such a cheerful smile that I never imagined she'd feel this way.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You failed to protect that which you swore to protect... That makes you the same as the rest of us.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Kotone stares vacantly up at me.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"Teardrops spill over from her round eyes.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hah!? My humblest apologies! That was a most shameful display!”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please forget what you just saw, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Kotone dabs at her face with her long sleeves.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"Even so, she fails to wipe up all her tears.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, you'll ruin that adorable face of yours.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wah! Mmmgg...”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"I wipe away her tears with my own fingers.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sins aren't forgiven so easily, and what's lost won't ever come back.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, let us atone however we can.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I offer my blade in service. What have you to offer?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My magicks! I have my magicks!”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, we've got our work cut out for us, don't we?”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"Tears pool up once again in her swollen eyes.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No more tears.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“R-Right!”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"She wipes her face with her sleeve one more time before showing me her usual, cheerful smile.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that's the Kotone I know and love.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... Uuuhhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Kotone flushes bright red and casts her gaze downwards.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Alright, I'll be off now.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks again for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, sir! Th-Thank you for your humble patronage, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Kotone bows over and over as she spews a flurry of incomprehensible nonsense.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"I can't help but smile to myself.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"With these warm feelings lingering in my bosom, I depart from the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
